# --- a priced Codex slug on --model (issue CQ·438) ----------------------------
#
# agent-platform#816 taught `_run_session` to route a Codex model to its own
# review branch, but `--model` accepted only MODEL_ALIASES and `_model_known`
# (override preflight condition 1) didn't recognise a Codex slug either, so
